# The pause menu's first tab, "Mario" (w/<language>/win.tpl image 1), as Peach's while she's the player
# (Play as Peach): the game's own tab with its lettering taken off, and "Peach" put on it letter by
# letter from the game's own lettering on its other tabs, recoloured to the "Mario" tab's pale pink with
# its dark red line, as luigi_tabs.recipe makes "Luigi". Loaded under Dolphin's name for the tab it
# replaces, in the "*#peach" texture set (luigi_faces_aurora.c, portLuigiFacesInit).
#
# The letters: P from "Party" (image 2), e from "Gear" (3), a the tab's own, c the tab's own o opened
# on its right, h the l of "Journal" (5) with its n beside it, the n's stem on the l's.
# US and the EU disc (whose five languages share this tab, and call her Peach in all five); the JP
# tab (ピーチ) isn't made yet: there the game's own tab shows.

image art/icons/peach/ui/tex1_96x40_b3df1434fe52ff08_14.png
  discs G8ME01 G8MP01
  load tpl w/us/win.tpl 1
  # the clean board (as luigi_tabs.recipe)
  mask frame rect 5 4 13 32
  mask frame + rect 87 4 91 32
  fill in frame #aa1900
  mask panel rect 15 5 85 31
  fill in panel #ce5542
  mask ledge rect 14 6 14 31
  fill in ledge #c0422c
  mask redge rect 86 6 86 31
  fill in redge #c0402c
  # P: "Party"'s (the pink tab)
  piece P tpl w/us/win.tpl 2
  @P crop 4 6 22 28
  @P alpha set 0 where h=300..345 s>=0.4 v>=0.5
  @P map #ecd1e6 -> #e6ccd3 #d671a5 -> #d05741 #ba427e -> #a91a00 #5a1030 -> #420c00
  # e: "Gear"'s (the orange tab)
  piece e tpl w/us/win.tpl 3
  @e crop 33 12 18 21
  @e alpha set 0 where h=25..60 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @e map #efd7ce -> #e6ccd3 #e7c794 -> #d05741 #8a5a10 -> #a91a00 #402800 -> #420c00
  # a: "Mario"'s own
  piece a tpl w/us/win.tpl 1
  @a crop 32 14 18 19
  @a alpha set 0 where h=0..20 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @a alpha set 0 where h=350..360 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  # c: "Mario"'s o, a notch cleared out of its right side
  piece c tpl w/us/win.tpl 1
  mask notch poly 84,23 94,17 94,30
  @c alpha set 0 in notch
  @c crop 75 14 18 20
  @c alpha set 0 where h=0..20 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @c alpha set 0 where h=350..360 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  # h: "Journal"'s l, and its n beside it (the blue tab), a little larger to stand with the rest
  piece l tpl w/us/win.tpl 5
  @l crop 84 11 8 18
  @l alpha set 0 where h=190..225 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @l map #ced3de -> #e6ccd3 #428fcd -> #d05741 #42516d -> #a91a00 #001031 -> #420c00
  @l scale 9 21 texel
  piece n tpl w/us/win.tpl 5
  @n crop 56 14 15 15
  @n alpha set 0 where h=190..225 s>=0.45 v>=0.5
  @n map #ced3de -> #e6ccd3 #428fcd -> #d05741 #475e75 -> #a91a00 #001031 -> #420c00
  @n scale 17 17 texel
  # on the baseline of "Mario" (row 32), close set as its letters are
  paste P 4 6
  paste e 24 12
  paste a 40 14
  paste c 56 14
  paste n 74 16
  paste l 71 12
end
